# Phase 3 motion, developer check (agent A): push/pop slides, slow and
# fast smooth scrolling with the scrollbar, and the marquee on a long
# selected label. Shots marked (timing) catch an animation mid-flight and
# depend on the host's timing: keep them out of goldens.
# Run with: SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p3-motion-dev.script
#
# #38 (docs/phase-nav-brief.md, "C: verification") retargets this from the
# Settings stub (now split, with panels) to Music > Songs, two pushes deep
# (main menu > Music > Songs) instead of Settings' one, so there are two
# push shots and two pop shots below; the scroll and marquee calibration
# matches the retargeted ipodui-p3-scroll.script and ipodui-p3-marquee.script
# (Songs is two-line, 5 rows/view; the marquee row is the "Ölfus ..." fixture,
# tests/ui/setup_library.py SPECIAL_TITLES, rank 161 of 297, reached by
# "wheel +165 100").
# golden: skip push_mid push2_mid glide_mid fast_mid marquee_2s marquee_lap pop_mid pop2_mid
# needs: library

wait 4000           # boot to the shell main menu
shot boot
wait_db 30000

key SELECT          # Music ("Playlists" selected)
wait 100
shot push_mid       # (timing) Music sliding in from the right
wait 700
shot music          # at rest

wheel +3            # "Songs"  [Compilations off: P11]
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 100
shot push2_mid      # (timing) Songs sliding in from the right
wait 700
shot songs          # at rest, "Amber Comet" first

# slow turn: one click every 250 ms = one row per click; rows 0-4 are
# visible at rest, so the 5th click makes the view glide
wheel +1
wait 250
wheel +1
wait 250
wheel +1
wait 250
wheel +1
wait 250
shot slow           # at rest on row 4, scrollbar still showing
wheel +1
shot glide_mid      # (timing) view gliding to keep row 5 on screen
wait 1500
shot slow_rest      # scrollbar gone: identical to a Phase 2 frame

# fast spin: 10 ms between clicks accelerates to the 5-steps-per-click cap
# (apps/ipodui/scroll.c WHEEL_STEPS_MAX); 400 clicks clamp at the end of
# the ~297-row list however the curve runs
wheel +400 10
shot fast_mid       # (timing) gliding, scrollbar showing
wait 500
shot fast_end       # settled at the bottom of the list, scrollbar showing
wait 1500
shot fast_rest

# marquee: the one song title long enough to overflow its row, 136 clicks
# up from the bottom (rank 161 of 297, tests/ui/setup_library.py, a
# handful more than the raw 135-row distance: empirically, a reversal
# right after a fast spin loses fewer clicks than a cold start does, but
# still loses one); 100 ms between clicks (10 clicks/s) stays under the
# no-acceleration threshold (WHEEL_ACCEL_V0 = 12), same margin as
# ipodui-p3-marquee.script
wheel -136 100
wait 300            # the glide settles
shot marquee_0      # label clipped, not moving yet (in the 1 s delay)
wait 2000
shot marquee_2s     # (timing) scrolled left
wait 3500
shot marquee_lap    # (timing) a lap later

key MENU            # back to Music
wait 100
shot pop_mid        # (timing) Music sliding back in from the left
wait 700
shot music_back     # at rest, back in Music

key MENU            # back to the main menu
wait 100
shot pop2_mid       # (timing) main menu sliding back in from the left
wait 700
shot back

quit
